  "a11y": [
    "The billing toggle is a real, keyboard-operable control: a role=group with a discernible accessible name (billing cycle) whose two options are native buttons reachable by Tab and activated by Space/Enter, each reflecting its state via aria-pressed, with a visible focus-visible ring (ring-ring offset from the background) in both themes.",
    "Each plan's feature check glyph is decorative: it is rendered aria-hidden so a screen reader never announces a bare icon name; whether a feature is included is carried entirely by its visible {it,en} feature text, never by the icon or colour alone.",
    "The recommended plan is signalled by more than colour: it carries a visible {it,en} badge and a distinct structure (lifted/centered card, accent border, filled CTA), so the highlighted plan is identifiable without perceiving the accent hue.",
    "One heading level per tier with a clean order: the optional section title is a heading (h2) and each plan name is the heading one level below it (h3); the eyebrow is decorative label text. Contrast holds in both dark and light because text uses foreground/muted-foreground and accent surfaces use the accent-driven tokens themed in :root and .dark, so axe A/AA stays clean in both themes and in both billing states."
  ],
  "forbidden": [
    "No raw HTML/code or SVG string in any prop and no dangerouslySetInnerHTML: every text field is an {it,en} plain string, the per-feature check glyph is the owned ICONS name-token resolved internally to a lucide component, and no prop lets a plan supply its own icon/graphic as markup or a ReactNode slot.",
    "No hardcoded hue or hex/oklch/hsl literal: colour comes only from the accent-driven and semantic tokens (bg-primary / text-primary-foreground / border-primary / border-border / bg-card / text-foreground / text-muted-foreground / --accent-ink / --acc-dim / --acc-line / ring-ring), never a fixed colour value, and spacing/radius use only named scale steps, never an arbitrary [13px]-style bracket.",
    "No more than one highlighted plan and never zero: the exactly-one-highlighted rule is enforced at the Zod boundary (a declaration with a highlighted-plan count other than one is refused as InvalidComponentPropsError naming plans), never silently rendered.",
    "No translating the prices: priceMonthly/priceAnnual are plain currency strings (e.g. \"9 EUR\" / \"90 EUR\"), never {it,en} objects, and the language toggle must not alter them; the monthly/annual switch is internal component state, not a raw-code prop."
  ],
